rows.en:
That's it, I'm mad☆
What on earth is with this guy☆
I lunged at him.{p}

Your past life was a paramecium.
And it was no flower, make no mistake.
There. Done.{p}

...But that's all we can ask Lord Warty Toad.
We've already asked three questions about you.
However... depending on your attitude, I might be willing to give you a more detailed reading.{p}

Well then, there's nothing more to ask Lord Warty Toad.
Lord Warty Toad, Lord Warty Toad, thank you very much.
Please go back home...{p}

Ah, but that's got nothing to do with your past life, has it?
What does have to do with your past life is...
I'm starting to see it, faintly, but I'm starting to see it!{p}

Could it be that you...!
No, not yet.
I can't say for sure yet.{p}

Then what color do you like?
...I see, I see.
So that's the kind of color you like.{p}

Hamburg steak, is it!
You're just like a little kid.
Be more adulty, like me.{p}
